        {
          "aspect": "surface element",
          "contract": "modal dialog, page behind inert, Escape closes, top of every stack",
          "realization": "A native <dialog part=\"dialog\"> in sb-dialog-content's shadow root, shown with showModal(), with a default slot; it provides the top layer, inertness and focus restore. Backdrop via ::backdrop. The reference uses a portal and a focus-trap script."
        },
