          "aspect": "name and description",
          "contract": "labelled by the title, described by the description",
          "realization": "ariaLabelledByElements / ariaDescribedByElements on the inner <dialog> pointing at the title and description hosts; aria-label copy of the title text where element references are unsupported (the title is observed, so a later change to its text is copied again; the description has no fallback and is omitted there); host aria-label on sb-dialog-content forwarded when there is no title. The title host is role heading, level 2 through ElementInternals (Playwright's role engine does not read it; the spec reads the browser's accessibility tree)."
